1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
A grid full of numbers...

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:05,200
with a few missing — can you fill them in?

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,460
This is Sudoku!

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:13,920
Every row, column, and box needs the same numbers, no repeats!

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,640
One, two...

6
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,880
and four are here — so the missing box must be three!

7
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,900
Tap the cell, tap the number, and the row locks into place!

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,900
No repeats in any row, column, or box — that's the whole puzzle!

9
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:39,300
Parents — this builds logic and careful thinking — smart, not fast!

10
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,960
Ready to test your logic?

11
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:47,920
Tap Math Game Zone, dig into Sudoku, pick your level, and get solving!

12
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,980
Abacus Kids — it's free on the App Store and Google Play!
